# Backlog / Future Work

## Packed Index Follow-Ups (deferred)

- **Children table (CSR)**: revisit when measured tree UI expand latency exceeds 50 ms.
- **Name interning**: revisit when the measured name pool exceeds 40 percent of block size.
- **Secondary name index**: revisit when the median warm exact or substring `FileIndex.Search` query exceeds 200 ms (`Benchmark.exe index --cache-directory <path> --iterations 3`).
- **Hard links as multiple rows per record**: revisit when a consumer needs the second name.

